    </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18015164\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/6b60769fe4536ae3385f9d6f13d52bdc?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"hxy100\" data-uid=\"41391\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>3</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/hxy100\">hxy100</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-25 13:35:47 +08:00\">19h 56m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>标准做法是直接在虚拟机里面运行 Agent ，把宿主机的某几个目录映射进去以供读写（一定程度上向物理隔离靠齐）。现在的所谓的 Agent ，你给它的权限约定只是防君子不防小人。完全依赖 AI 的自觉性，不是 100%靠谱。</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18015533\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/40eaa45a823f075189ca2a4f76343678?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"jackOff\" data-uid=\"593397\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>4</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/jackOff\">jackOff</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-25 14:32:52 +08:00\">18h 59m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>dsh 这玩意好像实现了权限隔离？</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18016289\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/5d8d7b94eb18bf5610ab219a2fd76f54?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"charles0\" data-uid=\"632499\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>6</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/charles0\">charles0</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-25 16:29:44 +08:00\">17h 2m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>\"禁止本地读取 XX\"的不叫防火墙，叫沙盒</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18016349\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/4676b54daa0f44b885474248e64b6972?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"ntdll\" data-uid=\"148771\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>7</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/ntdll\">ntdll</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-25 16:40:18 +08:00\">16h 52m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>比较简单的方案，是在 docker 里运行 agent ，即使投毒，也读不到宿主的信息。</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18016637\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/a97d/a629/107_normal.png?m=1764291462\" alt=\"ratazzi\" data-uid=\"107\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>8</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/ratazzi\">ratazzi</a></strong> &#160; <div><p>PRO</p></div>&#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-25 17:25:32 +08:00\">16h 6m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p><a target=\"_blank\" href=\"/i/FHGMs2GE.png\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" title=\"在新窗口打开图片 FHGMs2GE.png\"><img src=\"//i.v2ex.co/FHGMs2GE.png\"></a><br>我正在做，但和你想的不太一样</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n\n</div>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n            </div></DIV>","content_text":"问一下,有没有 AI 接口的防火墙类软件,比如 禁止本地读取 ssh key 、.env, 禁止向中转 api 传递 ssh key 、.env 等信息的软件 AI 防火墙 安全8 replies • 2026-08-25 17:25:32 +08:00 1 Bisn 20h 35m ago 试试 1Password ？ 2 x86 20h 25m ago 好像有的，以前我刷 v 站看有人自己做过一个来着 3 hxy100 19h 56m ago 标准做法是直接在虚拟机里面运行 Agen